status:  two local patches

The files in include/ and src/ are that commit with
patches/0001-guard-dimensions-and-allocations.patch applied. The patch adds
signed cell-index and allocation-size guards and allocation failure checks to
src/screen.c and src/vterm.c. The second patch preserves PuzzLLM's support
for RGB SGR sequences with a colon-delimited colour-space slot.

Only what the terminal builds is carried: the library's own tests, tools and
build files are left out.
